未申，尋至傾覆。昔宗周遭犬戎而東徙，有晉違獷狄而西遷，彼既靈慶悠長，此則禍難遄及，豈湣皇地非奧主，將綝允材謝輔臣，何修短之殊途，而成敗之異數者也？","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","source_position":{"first_line":131,"last_line":131,"raw_start":11047,"raw_end":11240,"raw_character_offsets":[11053,11054,11055,11059,11060,11061,11062,11063,11064,11065,11066,11067,11068,11069,11070,11071,11072,11073,11074,11075,11076,11077,11078,11079,11080,11081,11082,11083,11084,11085,11086,11087,11088,11089,11090,11091,11092,11093,11094,11095,11096,11097,11098,11099,11100,11101,11102,11103,11104,11105,11106,11107,11108,11109,11110,11111,11112,11113,11114,11115,11116,11117,11118,11119,11120,11121,11122,11123,11124,11125,11126,11127,11128,11129,11130,11131,11132,11133,11134,11135,11136,11137,11138,11139,11140,11141,11142,11143,11144,11145,11146,11147,11148,11149,11150,11151,11152,11153,11154,11155,11156,11157,11158,11159,11160,11161,11162,11163,11164,11165,11166,11167,11168,11169,11170,11171,11172,11173,11174,11175,11176,11177,11178,11179,11180,11181,11182,11183,11184,11185,11186,11187,11188,11189,11190,11191,11192,11193,11194,11195,11196,11197,11198,11199,11200,11201,11202,11203,11204,11205,11206,11207,11208,11209,11210,11211,11212,11213,11214,11215,11216,11217,11218,11219,11220,11221,11222,11223,11224,11225,11226,11227,11228,11229,11230,11231,11232,11233,11234,11235,11236,11237,11238,11239],"revision_id":2413335},"mentions":[{"id":"c-jinshu-060-appraisal-second:p001:m0047","surface":"閻鼎","start":47,"end":49,"person_id":"emm_pbx_36w","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-060-appraisal-second:p001:m0153","surface":"湣皇","start":153,"end":155,"person_id":"pss_n95_7x4","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-060-appraisal-second:p001:m0161","surface":"綝","start":161,"end":162,"person_id":"u3p_4ou_4st","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-jinshu-060-appraisal-second","book_id":"b-jinshu-060","work_id":"w-jinshu","source_id":"s-jinshu-060-appraisal-second-ws2413335"},{"id":"c-jinshu-060-eulogy:p001","text":"贊曰：懷惠不競，戚籓力爭。狙詐參謀，憑凶亂政。為惡不已，並羅非命。解繆忠肅，無聞余慶。湣皇纂戎，實賴群公。鼎圖福始，綝遂凶終。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","source_position":{"first_line":134,"last_line":134,"raw_start":11250,"raw_end":11315,"raw_character_offsets":[11252,11253,11254,11255,11256,11257,11258,11259,11260,11261,11262,11263,11264,11265,11266,11267,11268,11269,11270,11271,11272,11273,11274,11275,11276,11277,11278,11279,11280,11281,11282,11283,11284,11285,11286,11287,11288,11289,11290,11291,11292,11293,11294,11295,11296,11297,11298,11299,11300,11301,11302,11303,11304,11305,11306,11307,11308,11309,11310,11311,11312,11313,11314],"revision_id":2413335},"mentions":[{"id":"c-jinshu-060-eulogy:p001:m0043","surface":"湣皇","start":43,"end":45,"person_id":"pss_n95_7x4","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-060-eulogy:p001:m0053","surface":"鼎","start":53,"end":54,"person_id":"emm_pbx_36w","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-jinshu-060-eulogy:p001:m0058","surface":"綝","start":58,"end":59,"person_id":"u3p_4ou_4st","kind":"person","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-jinshu-060-eulogy","book_id":"b-jinshu-060","work_id":"w-jinshu","source_id":"s-jinshu-060-eulogy-ws2413335"},{"id":"c-jinshu-060-suochen:p003","text":"及懷帝蒙塵，長安又陷，模被害，綝泣曰：「與其俱死，寧為伍子胥。」乃赴安定，與雍州刺史賈疋、扶風太守梁綜、安夷護軍麹允等糾合義眾，頻破賊黨，修復舊館，遷定宗廟。進救新平，小大百戰，綝手擒賊帥李羌，與閻鼎立秦王為皇太子，及即尊位，是為湣帝。綝遷侍中、太僕，以首迎大駕、升壇授璽之功，封弋居伯。又遷前將軍、尚書右僕射、領吏部、京兆尹，加平東將軍，進號征東。尋又詔曰：「朕昔遇厄運，遭家不造，播越宛楚，爰失舊京。幸宗廟寵靈，百辟宣力，得從籓衛，托乎群公之上。社稷之不隕，實公是賴，宜贊百揆，傅弼朕躬。其授衛將軍，領太尉，位特進，軍國之事悉以委之。」","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","source_position":{"first_line":120,"last_line":120,"raw_start":9710,"raw_end":9982,"raw_character_offsets":[9712,9713,9714,9715,9716,9717,9718,9719,9720,9721,9722,9723,9724,9725,9726,9727,9728,9729,9730,9731,9732,9733,9734,9735,9736,9737,9738,9739,9740,9741,9742,9743,9744,9745,9746,9747,9748,9749,9750,9751,9752,9753,9754,9755,